msgid ""
"**Dark Primary**: `#1e1f23` background, white text, 6px radius, `10px "
"12px` padding. Hover: opacity 0.7 with Amber Gold text. Active: opacity "
"0.8 with slight scale transform. The main CTA — dark and confident"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_posthog.md:110
msgid ""
"**Sage Light**: `#e5e7e0` background, Olive Ink (`#4d4f46`) text, 4px "
