"Compact utility button"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_posthog.md:111
msgid ""
"**Warm Tan Featured**: `#d4c9b8` background, black text, no visible "
"radius. Hover: same orange text flash. Featured/premium actions"
msgstr ""

