#: ../../source/templates_posthog.md:160
msgid ""
"**Content-dense by design**: PostHog's site is information-rich — "
"whitespace is measured, not lavish"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_posthog.md:161
msgid ""
"**Editorial pacing**: Content sections flow like a magazine with varied "
"layouts keeping the eye moving"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_posthog.md:162
msgid ""
"**Illustrations as breathing room**: Hand-drawn hedgehog art breaks up "
"dense content sections naturally"
msgstr ""

