#: ../../source/templates_posthog.md:179
msgid "Shadow Philosophy"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_posthog.md:180
msgid ""
"PostHog's elevation system is remarkably minimal — only one shadow "
"definition exists in the entire system. Depth is communicated through:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_posthog.md:181
msgid ""
"**Border containment**: Sage-tinted borders (`#bfc1b7`) at 1px create "
"gentle warm separation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_posthog.md:182
msgid ""
"**Surface color shifts**: Moving from `#fdfdf8` to `#eeefe9` to `#e5e7e0`"
" creates layered depth without shadows"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_posthog.md:183
msgid ""
"**The single shadow**: The one defined shadow (`0 25px 50px -12px`) is "
"reserved for floating elements — modals, dropdowns, popovers. It's a "
"deep, dramatic shadow that creates clear separation when needed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_posthog.md:185
msgid "Decorative Depth"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_posthog.md:186
msgid ""
"**Illustration layering**: Hand-drawn hedgehog art creates visual depth "
"naturally"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_posthog.md:187
msgid ""
"**No gradients or glow**: The flat, warm surface system relies entirely "
"on border and surface-color differentiation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_posthog.md:188
msgid "**No glassmorphism**: Fully opaque surfaces throughout"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_posthog.md:190
msgid "7. Do's and Don'ts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_posthog.md:192
msgid "Do"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_posthog.md:193
msgid ""
"Use the olive/sage color family (#4d4f46, #23251d, #bfc1b7) for text and "
"borders — the warm green undertone is essential to the brand"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_posthog.md:194
msgid ""
"Flash PostHog Orange (#F54E00) on hover states — it's the hidden brand "
"signature"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_posthog.md:195
msgid ""
"Use IBM Plex Sans at bold weights (700/800) for headings — the font "
"carries technical credibility"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_posthog.md:196
msgid ""
"Keep body text at generous line-heights (1.50–1.71) — the content-heavy "
"site demands readability"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_posthog.md:197
msgid ""
"Maintain the warm parchment background (#fdfdf8) — not pure white, never "
"cold"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_posthog.md:198
msgid ""
"Use 4px border-radius for most UI elements — keep corners subtle and "
"functional"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_posthog.md:199
msgid ""
"Include playful, hand-drawn illustration elements — the personality is "
"the differentiator"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_posthog.md:200
msgid ""
"Apply opacity-based hover states (0.7 opacity) on dark buttons rather "
"than color shifts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_posthog.md:202
msgid "Don't"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_posthog.md:203
msgid ""
"Use blue, purple, or typical tech-SaaS colors — PostHog's palette is "
"deliberately olive/sage"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_posthog.md:204
msgid ""
"Add heavy shadows — the system uses one shadow for floating elements "
"only; everything else uses borders"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_posthog.md:205
msgid ""
"Make the design look \"polished\" or \"premium\" in a conventional sense "
"— PostHog's charm is its irreverent, scrappy energy"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_posthog.md:206
msgid ""
"Use tight line-heights on body text — the generous 1.50+ spacing is "
"essential for the content-heavy layout"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_posthog.md:207
msgid ""
"Apply large border-radius (12px+) on cards — PostHog uses 4px–6px, "
"keeping things tight and functional"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_posthog.md:208
msgid ""
"Remove the orange hover flash — it's a core interaction pattern, not "
"decoration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_posthog.md:209
msgid ""
"Replace illustrations with stock photography — the hand-drawn hedgehog "
"art is the brand"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_posthog.md:210
msgid ""
"Use pure white (#ffffff) as page background — the warm sage-cream "
"(#fdfdf8) tint is foundational"
msgstr ""

